            "notes": "# Round 1 Notes \u2013 Mercy \ud83d\udd4a\ufe0f\ud83d\udc9b\n\n## Power Choice:\n\n-Start with [Triage Unit](item_fec0554c-2685-4b93-822d-bf0020e654b4) to clutch-save allies when they dip below half HP.\n\n## Items:\n\n-[Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0) + [Weapon Grease](item_961ae72f-434f-406b-a89b-ab8efec806bf) \u2192 [Weapon Power](stat_weapon_power) + [Attack Speed](stat_attack_speed) = stronger, faster heals.\n\n-[Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6) \u2192 early armor to survive dives and poke.\n\n**Gameplan: Focus on keeping frontline alive with consistent beam uptime. Use [Triage Unit](item_fec0554c-2685-4b93-822d-bf0020e654b4) as your \u201cpanic button\u201d to swing early trades in your favor.**",
