            "notes": "# Round 5 Notes \u2013 [Mercy](hero_0e213bfc-3ca9-49c6-9036-e7f344b752da)\ud83d\udd4a\ufe0f\ud83d\udc9b\n\n## Power Choice:\n\n-Grab [Protective Beam](item_3f1ef995-8ecc-45fb-8b57-26fdccc21feb) to give tethered allies damage reduction.\n\n## Items:\n\n-Grab [Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a) if you haven't already for increased [Weapon Power](stat_weapon_power) for healing purposes. \n\n-Upgrade [Long Distance Wings](item_8b4bafad-c8bc-4c77-bbe7-798b03920c88) \u2192 [Angelic Acrobatics](item_baad85fc-3da5-43af-ad9d-f17885f59aa5), then [Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6)/[Crusader Hydraulics](item_b64cee07-ca32-405d-987e-868b415bbc09) \u2192 [Ogundimu Reduction Field](item_b12daf48-069b-44c1-88fe-221cbcff664d) (if you're struggling to stay alive).\n\n**Gameplan: [Protective Beam](item_3f1ef995-8ecc-45fb-8b57-26fdccc21feb) makes you and your frontline harder to break. Play anchored around tanks, chaining beam uptime with [Threads of Fate](item_cb61612b-9d83-49a9-989d-013bf084fbcb).**",
